OL,3,A'I survived the epicentre of 9/11 - I'm
OL,4,Aso lucky'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains graphic
OL,7,Fdetails of the aftermath from the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks.
OL,10,FOn 11 September 2001, photographer and
OL,11,Fdocumentary filmmaker Paul Berriff was
OL,12,Fliving and working in New York City.
OL,14,FHe was caught up in the 9/11 attacks
OL,15,Fand still remembers the day in vivid
OL,16,Fdetail.
OL,18,FMore recently, he has become one of
OL,19,Fthousands of survivors to be diagnosed
OL,20,Fwith terminal illnesses connected with
OL,21,Fthe long-term effects of that day.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
